{"duration_api_ms":10871,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2cf95239-adb2-44ae-bc08-a68115925068","total_cost_usd":0.026144,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":860,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":64},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":860,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":860,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1117,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.026144,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":64,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# Ticket Classification & Routing\n\n**Fixture:** customer-support-2026-09-16-v2-technical\n**User:** user_a\n\n## Query\n> \"The mobile app crashes with an error and is not working after the update.\"\n\n## Classification\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **category** | `technical` (Technical Issue) |\n| **owner_team** | Technical Support |\n| **priority** | P2 |\n| **sla** | 1 business day |\n\n**Why this category:** The query matches these keywords for the `technical` category: **\"app\"**, **\"crash\"** (as \"crashes\"), **\"error\"**, **\"not working\"** and **\"update\"**. `technical` is also the configured `default_category`, so the classification holds either way.\n\n## Routing Decision\nRoute to **Technical Support** at **P2**, with a **1 business day** SLA.\n\n## Policy Application\nFrozen policy: *\"Collect reproduction steps and device information, then route to technical support for diagnosis.\"*\n\n- The ticket goes to Technical Support for diagnosis.\n- The query does not include reproduction steps or device information, so we must collect these as part of the handoff.\n\n## Next Actions\n1. **Collect reproduction steps.** Ask what the user does just before the crash, such as launching the app or opening a specific screen, and whether it happens every time.\n2. **Ask for the device and app version.** Request the device model, OS version and the app version installed after the update.\n3. **Route to Technical Support with logs if available.** Ask for the exact error message, a screenshot, or crash logs, and attach whatever the user provides to the ticket.\n\n## Missing Information\nThe supplied data does not include the following, and none of it has been assumed:\n- Device model and operating system\n- App version, and which update triggered the issue\n- Exact error message text or code\n- Reproduction steps and how often the crash happens\n- Crash logs or screenshots\n- Any account history or earlier tickets for `user_a` (`shared_context` is empty)\n\n## Suggested Customer Reply\n> Thanks for letting us know, and sorry the app is crashing after the update. To help our Technical Support team diagnose this, could you please share:\n> - Your device model and OS version\n> - The app version you're currently on\n> - The exact error message you see (a screenshot is helpful)\n> - The steps that lead to the crash, and whether it happens every time\n>\n> Once we have these details, your ticket will be handled by Technical Support within 1 business day.","ttft_ms":2786,"type":"result","duration_ms":10909,"uuid":"1ce42486-8bd3-4a4b-8368-409ebb6a3333","ttft_stream_ms":1994,"time_to_request_ms":36,"first_content_frame_ms":1994,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
